#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_log_cold_chain.report_cold_chain_compliance_document
msgid ""
"This certificate is issued under the responsibility of the operator named "
"above based on the recorded data above. The compliance verdict reflects the "
"absence (COMPLIANT) or presence (NON-COMPLIANT) of cargo-impacting "
"deviations."
msgstr ""
"Sertifikat ini diterbitkan di bawah tanggung jawab operator yang disebutkan "
"di atas berdasarkan data yang direkam di atas. Putusan kepatuhan "
"mencerminkan ketiadaan (COMPLIANT) atau keberadaan (NON-COMPLIANT) "
"penyimpangan yang memengaruhi kargo."

#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_cold_chain.field_eh_log_cold_chain_profile__excursion_grace_minutes
msgid ""
"Time after a deviation closes before the run returns to nominal status. "
"Allows readings to fully stabilise."
msgstr ""
"Waktu setelah deviasi ditutup sebelum proses kembali ke status nominal. "
"Memungkinkan pembacaan untuk sepenuhnya stabil."

#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_log_cold_chain.selection__eh_log_cold_chain_deviation__cause__transit_delay
msgid "Transit Delay"
msgstr "Keterlambatan Transit"

#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_cold_chain.field_eh_log_cold_chain_run__is_compliant
msgid ""
"True when no cargo-impacting deviation has been recorded and at least one "
"reading has been ingested. Drives the compliance certificate verdict."
msgstr ""
"True ketika tidak ada penyimpangan yang berdampak pada kargo yang tercatat "
"dan setidaknya satu pembacaan telah dimasukkan. Menentukan putusan "
"sertifikat kepatuhan."

#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_cold_chain.field_eh_log_cold_chain_reading__is_breach
msgid ""
"True when this individual reading is outside the run's profile thresholds. "
"The deviation detector aggregates sustained breaches across continuous time "
"windows."
msgstr ""
"True ketika pembacaan individual ini berada di luar ambang profil run. "
"Detektor penyimpangan menggabungkan pelanggaran yang berkelanjutan di "
"seluruh jendela waktu yang kontinu."

#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_cold_chain.field_eh_log_cold_chain_deviation__activity_exception_decoration
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_cold_chain.field_eh_log_cold_chain_run__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "Jenis dari aktivitas pengecualian pada rekaman data."

#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_cold_chain.field_eh_log_cold_chain_profile__temperature_max
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_cold_chain.field_eh_log_cold_chain_run__profile_temperature_max
msgid ""
"Upper threshold. Readings above this trigger a deviation after the alert "
"window elapses."
msgstr ""
"Ambang atas. Pembacaan di atas nilai ini memicu penyimpangan setelah jendela"
" peringatan berakhir."

